{
  "$comment": "Exponential Desktop's factory start menu (#EDE-52): Mint's menu, opened from the taskbar's Exponential button bottom-left (or Super) as a popup surface above it, 760×620, with the keyboard. Three columns: the person (/user), the desktop/team switcher under it (#EDE-65, moved here from the sidebar: the current entry, its menu lists /shell/switcher/sections with New local desktop, Share as a team only on a Local desktop and Connect Exponential only without an account, /shell/switcher/connection; ede_switcher pick/new/share/connect, a pick closes the menu, is remembered and the Exponential app follows a team) with the favourites (the taskbar's pins) and lock / log out / power at the bottom; the categories (/shell/startMenu/categories: All applications, Favourites, Exponential, Accessories, … in Mint's order, the current one selected); the app rows with icon, name and description (/shell/startMenu/apps: the category's apps, or the ranked matches while the search box at the bottom has text; #EDE-65: then Issues, /shell/startMenu/issues: the issue-search engine's hits across every connected team and the Local desktops, at most 8, each with its status, identifier and `team · board`, ede_issue {identifier, source, sourceId} opens it in the Exponential app, on its team or Local desktop (the switcher and the app go there first when it is another one); the groups are labelled while both have rows). Entries include the Exponential app, Files (Nemo) and Version history (#EDE-53) with the installed applications. Footer: What's new, the account, Devices, Settings (ede_open_document settings). The IDE opens the same document over its window (#EXP-1723; it prunes the switcher, its sidebar has its own): an entry there names a concept or a host glyph in glyph, instead of an image in icon.",
  "surface": {
    "popup": {
      "parent": "taskbar",
      "anchor": "start",
      "placement": "top-start",
      "size": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 620
      }
    },
    "functions": [
      "ede_launch",
      "ede_lock",
      "ede_logout",
      "ede_power",
      "ede_open_document",
      "ede_switcher",
      "ede_start_menu",
      "ede_issue"
    ]
  },
  "root": {
    "id": "start_menu",
    "component": "Box",
    "style": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "width": 760,
      "height": 620,
      "backgroundColor": "$color.popover",
      "borderWidth": 1,
      "borderColor": "$color.border",
      "borderRadius": "$radius.lg"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "columns",
        "component": "Box",
        "style": {
          "display": "flex",
          "flexDirection": "row",
          "flexGrow": 1,
          "minHeight": 0
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "left",
            "component": "Box",
            "style": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flexDirection": "column",
              "width": 220,
              "flexShrink": 0,
              "padding": "$spacing.sm",
              "gap": "$spacing.xs",
              "borderRightWidth": 1,
              "borderColor": "$color.border"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "person",
                "component": "Row",
                "props": {
                  "title": {
                    "@path": "/user/name"
                  },
                  "subtitle": {
                    "@path": "/user/host"
                  },
                  "density": "default"
                },
                "slots": {
                  "leading": {
                    "id": "person_avatar",
                    "component": "Avatar",
                    "props": {
                      "name": {
                        "@path": "/user/name"
                      },
                      "seed": {
                        "@path": "/user/login"
                      },
                      "size": "lg"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "switcher",
                "component": "Box",
                "props": {
                  "pressable": true
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "flex",
                  "flexDirection": "row",
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "gap": "$spacing.sm",
                  "height": 40,
                  "paddingLeft": "$spacing.xs",
                  "paddingRight": "$spacing.xs",
                  "borderRadius": "$radius.md",
                  "minWidth": 0,
                  "flexShrink": 0
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "switcher_avatar",
                    "component": "Avatar",
                    "props": {
                      "name": {
                        "@path": "/shell/switcher/current/name"
                      },
                      "size": "default"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "switcher_name",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "props": {
                      "text": {
                        "@path": "/shell/switcher/current/name"
                      },
                      "variant": "label",
                      "lines": 1
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "switcher_chevron",
                    "component": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                      "name": "nav-team-switcher",
                      "size": "sm",
                      "tone": "neutral"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "switcher_menu",
                "component": "Popover",
                "props": {
                  "anchor": "switcher",
                  "side": "bottom",
                  "align": "start"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "switcher_list",
                    "component": "Box",
                    "style": {
                      "display": "flex",
                      "flexDirection": "column",
                      "gap": "$spacing.xxs",
                      "width": 240,
                      "padding": "$spacing.xs"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_sections",
                        "component": "List",
                        "props": {
                          "gap": "xs"
                        },
                        "template": {
                          "component": "switcher_section",
                          "path": "/shell/switcher/sections",
                          "key": "id"
                        },
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_section",
                        "component": "Box",
                        "style": {
                          "display": "flex",
                          "flexDirection": "column",
                          "gap": "$spacing.xxs"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "id": "switcher_section_label",
                            "component": "Text",
                            "props": {
                              "text": {
                                "@path": "label"
                              },
                              "variant": "caption",
                              "lines": 1
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "switcher_entries",
                            "component": "List",
                            "props": {
                              "gap": "none"
                            },
                            "template": {
                              "component": "switcher_entry",
                              "path": "entries",
                              "key": "id"
                            },
                            "children": []
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "switcher_entry",
                            "component": "Row",
                            "props": {
                              "title": {
                                "@path": "name"
                              },
                              "density": "compact",
                              "pressable": true,
                              "selected": {
                                "@path": "current"
                              }
                            },
                            "slots": {
                              "leading": {
                                "id": "switcher_entry_avatar",
                                "component": "Avatar",
                                "props": {
                                  "name": {
                                    "@path": "name"
                                  },
                                  "size": "sm"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "on": {
                              "press": {
                                "functionCall": {
                                  "@call": "ede_switcher",
                                  "args": {
                                    "action": "pick",
                                    "kind": {
                                      "@path": "kind"
                                    },
                                    "id": {
                                      "@path": "id"
                                    },
                                    "account": {
                                      "@path": "account"
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_sep",
                        "component": "Separator"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_new",
                        "component": "Row",
                        "props": {
                          "title": "New local desktop",
                          "icon": "ui-add",
                          "density": "compact",
                          "pressable": true
                        },
                        "on": {
                          "press": {
                            "functionCall": {
                              "@call": "ede_switcher",
                              "args": {
                                "action": "new"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_share",
                        "component": "Row",
                        "props": {
                          "title": "Share as a team…",
                          "icon": "ui-share",
                          "density": "compact",
                          "pressable": true
                        },
                        "on": {
                          "press": {
                            "functionCall": {
                              "@call": "ede_switcher",
                              "args": {
                                "action": "share"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "visible": {
                          "@call": "cond",
                          "args": {
                            "if": {
                              "@path": "/shell/switcher/connection/onLocal"
                            },
                            "then": true,
                            "else": false
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "switcher_connect",
                        "component": "Row",
                        "props": {
                          "title": "Connect Exponential",
                          "icon": "brand-exponential",
                          "density": "compact",
                          "pressable": true
                        },
                        "on": {
                          "press": {
                            "functionCall": {
                              "@call": "ede_switcher",
                              "args": {
                                "action": "connect"
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "visible": {
                          "@call": "not",
                          "args": {
                            "value": {
                              "@call": "cond",
                              "args": {
                                "if": {
                                  "@path": "/shell/switcher/connection/connected"
                                },
                                "then": true,
                                "else": false
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "favourites_label",
                "component": "Text",
                "props": {
                  "text": "Favourites",
                  "variant": "caption"
                },
                "style": {
                  "paddingLeft": "$spacing.sm",
                  "paddingTop": "$spacing.xs"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "favourites_scroll",
                "component": "ScrollArea",
                "style": {
                  "flexGrow": 1,
                  "minHeight": 0
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "favourites",
                    "component": "List",
                    "props": {
                      "gap": "none"
                    },
                    "template": {
                      "component": "favourite",
                      "path": "/shell/startMenu/favourites",
                      "key": "id"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "favourite",
                    "component": "Row",
                    "props": {
                      "title": {
                        "@path": "name"
                      },
                      "density": "compact",
                      "pressable": true,
                      "icon": {
                        "@path": "glyph"
                      }
                    },
                    "slots": {
                      "leading": {
                        "id": "favourite_icon",
                        "component": "Image",
                        "props": {
                          "src": {
                            "@path": "icon"
                          },
                          "alt": {
                            "@path": "name"
                          },
                          "width": 20,
                          "height": 20,
                          "fit": "contain",
                          "fallback": "nav-apps"
                        },
                        "visible": {
                          "@call": "cond",
                          "args": {
                            "if": {
                              "@path": "icon"
                            },
                            "then": true,
                            "else": false
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_launch",
                          "args": {
                            "app": {
                              "@path": "id"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "no_favourites",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "props": {
                      "text": "Pin an app to the taskbar",
                      "variant": "muted"
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "paddingLeft": "$spacing.sm"
                    },
                    "visible": {
                      "@call": "eq",
                      "args": {
                        "a": {
                          "@call": "len",
                          "args": {
                            "value": {
                              "@path": "/shell/startMenu/favourites"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "b": 0
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "power_row",
                "component": "Stack",
                "props": {
                  "direction": "horizontal",
                  "gap": "sm",
                  "align": "center"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "lock",
                    "component": "Button",
                    "props": {
                      "icon": "ede-lock",
                      "variant": "outline",
                      "size": "icon",
                      "label": "Lock"
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_lock"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "logout",
                    "component": "Button",
                    "props": {
                      "icon": "nav-sign-out",
                      "variant": "outline",
                      "size": "icon",
                      "label": "Log out"
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_logout"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "power",
                    "component": "Menu",
                    "props": {
                      "side": "top",
                      "align": "start",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "label": "Suspend",
                          "value": "suspend",
                          "icon": "ede-suspend"
                        },
                        {
                          "label": "Restart",
                          "value": "reboot",
                          "icon": "ui-refresh"
                        },
                        {
                          "label": "Shut down",
                          "value": "poweroff",
                          "icon": "ede-power",
                          "destructive": true
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "select": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_power",
                          "args": {
                            "action": {
                              "@path": "value"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "id": "power_button",
                        "component": "Button",
                        "props": {
                          "icon": "ede-power",
                          "variant": "destructive",
                          "size": "icon",
                          "label": "Power"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "middle",
            "component": "Box",
            "style": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flexDirection": "column",
              "width": 200,
              "flexShrink": 0,
              "padding": "$spacing.sm",
              "borderRightWidth": 1,
              "borderColor": "$color.border"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "categories_scroll",
                "component": "ScrollArea",
                "style": {
                  "flexGrow": 1,
                  "minHeight": 0
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "categories",
                    "component": "List",
                    "props": {
                      "gap": "none"
                    },
                    "template": {
                      "component": "category",
                      "path": "/shell/startMenu/categories",
                      "key": "id"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "category",
                    "component": "Row",
                    "props": {
                      "title": {
                        "@path": "label"
                      },
                      "icon": {
                        "@path": "icon"
                      },
                      "density": "compact",
                      "pressable": true,
                      "selected": {
                        "@path": "selected"
                      }
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_start_menu",
                          "args": {
                            "category": {
                              "@path": "id"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "right",
            "component": "Box",
            "style": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flexDirection": "column",
              "flexGrow": 1,
              "minWidth": 0,
              "padding": "$spacing.sm"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "apps_scroll",
                "component": "ScrollArea",
                "style": {
                  "flexGrow": 1,
                  "minHeight": 0
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "apps_label",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "props": {
                      "text": "Apps",
                      "variant": "caption"
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "paddingLeft": "$spacing.sm",
                      "paddingTop": "$spacing.xs"
                    },
                    "visible": {
                      "@call": "and",
                      "args": {
                        "values": [
                          {
                            "@call": "not",
                            "args": {
                              "value": {
                                "@call": "eq",
                                "args": {
                                  "a": {
                                    "@call": "len",
                                    "args": {
                                      "value": {
                                        "@path": "/shell/startMenu/apps"
                                      }
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "b": 0
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "@call": "not",
                            "args": {
                              "value": {
                                "@call": "eq",
                                "args": {
                                  "a": {
                                    "@call": "len",
                                    "args": {
                                      "value": {
                                        "@path": "/shell/startMenu/issues"
                                      }
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "b": 0
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "apps",
                    "component": "List",
                    "props": {
                      "gap": "none"
                    },
                    "template": {
                      "component": "app",
                      "path": "/shell/startMenu/apps",
                      "key": "id"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "app",
                    "component": "Row",
                    "props": {
                      "title": {
                        "@path": "name"
                      },
                      "subtitle": {
                        "@path": "comment"
                      },
                      "pressable": true,
                      "density": "default",
                      "icon": {
                        "@path": "glyph"
                      }
                    },
                    "slots": {
                      "leading": {
                        "id": "app_icon",
                        "component": "Image",
                        "props": {
                          "src": {
                            "@path": "icon"
                          },
                          "alt": {
                            "@path": "name"
                          },
                          "width": 24,
                          "height": 24,
                          "fit": "contain",
                          "fallback": "nav-apps"
                        },
                        "visible": {
                          "@call": "cond",
                          "args": {
                            "if": {
                              "@path": "icon"
                            },
                            "then": true,
                            "else": false
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_launch",
                          "args": {
                            "app": {
                              "@path": "id"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "issues_label",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "props": {
                      "text": "Issues",
                      "variant": "caption"
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "paddingLeft": "$spacing.sm",
                      "paddingTop": "$spacing.xs"
                    },
                    "visible": {
                      "@call": "not",
                      "args": {
                        "value": {
                          "@call": "eq",
                          "args": {
                            "a": {
                              "@call": "len",
                              "args": {
                                "value": {
                                  "@path": "/shell/startMenu/issues"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "b": 0
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "issues",
                    "component": "List",
                    "props": {
                      "gap": "none"
                    },
                    "template": {
                      "component": "issue",
                      "path": "/shell/startMenu/issues",
                      "key": "id"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "issue",
                    "component": "Row",
                    "props": {
                      "title": {
                        "@path": "title"
                      },
                      "identifier": {
                        "@path": "identifier"
                      },
                      "subtitle": {
                        "@path": "context"
                      },
                      "icon": {
                        "@path": "icon"
                      },
                      "pressable": true,
                      "density": "default"
                    },
                    "on": {
                      "press": {
                        "functionCall": {
                          "@call": "ede_issue",
                          "args": {
                            "identifier": {
                              "@path": "identifier"
                            },
                            "source": {
                              "@path": "source"
                            },
                            "sourceId": {
                              "@path": "sourceId"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "no_apps",
                    "component": "EmptyState",
                    "props": {
                      "icon": "ui-empty-search",
                      "title": "No results",
                      "size": "list"
                    },
                    "visible": {
                      "@call": "and",
                      "args": {
                        "values": [
                          {
                            "@call": "eq",
                            "args": {
                              "a": {
                                "@call": "len",
                                "args": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "@path": "/shell/startMenu/apps"
                                  }
                                }
                              },
                              "b": 0
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "@call": "eq",
                            "args": {
                              "a": {
                                "@call": "len",
                                "args": {
                                  "value": {
                                    "@path": "/shell/startMenu/issues"
                                  }
                                }
                              },
                              "b": 0
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "bottom",
        "component": "Box",
        "style": {
          "display": "flex",
          "flexDirection": "row",
          "alignItems": "center",
          "gap": "$spacing.sm",
          "padding": "$spacing.sm",
          "borderTopWidth": 1,
          "borderColor": "$color.border"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "search",
            "component": "Input",
            "props": {
              "type": "search",
              "name": "query",
              "label": "Search",
              "placeholder": "Search apps and issues",
              "value": {
                "@path": "/shell/startMenu/query"
              }
            },
            "style": {
              "flexGrow": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "whats_new",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": "nav-changelog",
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": "What's new"
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_launch",
                  "args": {
                    "app": "at.exponential"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "account",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": "nav-account",
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": "Account"
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_launch",
                  "args": {
                    "app": "at.exponential"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "devices",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": "nav-devices",
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": "Devices"
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_launch",
                  "args": {
                    "app": "at.exponential"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "settings",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": "nav-settings",
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": "Settings"
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_open_document",
                  "args": {
                    "name": "settings"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
